edits_description = "The text and the person were removed and the image was cropped."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_jg17w")
province = 57
blurb = "Depicts the Raigo (\"descent\") valley in Ōyama (\"big mountain\") in Sagami province, today's Isehara city, Kanagawa prefecture.

In the Edo period, Ōyama was a very popular pilgrimage site. Pilgrimages to it were called Ōyama-mairi.

In the center, framed by the valley, is Mount Fuji. In the upper right is a torii gate, likely leading to either the Ōyama Temple or the Ōyama Afuri Shrine."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
